n sets and forms\n\n- Introduced QuestionSet, FormData, FormStepData, FormSection, FormField, and related types.\n- Established a clear structure for form data and question sets to ensure type safety.\n\ntest: Add unit tests for validation utilities\n\n- Implemented comprehensive tests for validateQuestionSet, validateQuestionSets, validateFormData, and validateSubmissionResponse functions.\n- Ensured validation logic correctly handles valid and invalid data scenarios.\n\nfeat: Create validation utilities for API response data\n\n- Developed validation functions for QuestionSet, FormData, FormSection, FormField, and SubmissionResponse.\n- Utilized TypeScript type guards to ensure data integrity and provide descriptive error messages.","tree":{"sha":"6feb72f5576ec4ef5c7fb2aca645b90800ac3d92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/spec-kit-starter/git/trees/6feb72f5576ec4ef5c7fb2aca645b90800ac3d92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/spec-kit-starter/git/commits/fb2dc2ba1cb6fe478e87f9eb8f9b56b2ae0b4c7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38785848?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/buisihung11","id":38785848,"login":"buisihung11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4Nzg1ODQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.