:"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/778c2d2639c4d2784ba6b5b31c05153a7f1f63ac"}],"sha":"88cdb7a4f424130fcd45ff6faf4571ef8d6a95df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/88cdb7a4f424130fcd45ff6faf4571ef8d6a95df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/778c2d2639c4d2784ba6b5b31c05153a7f1f63ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T05:27:01Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T05:27:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: platform MF 연계 + 그래프 파이프라인 버그 수정 + 문서 재편 (#35)\n\n* fix: custom LLM providers in graph ingest + fetch_chunks NameError\n\n- ingest_service _get_llm/_get_embedding_model: LlamaIndex는 base_url이 아니라\n  api_base 를 사용하므로 base_url= 을 api_base= 로 수정(무시되어 커스텀 키가\n  OpenAI 로 가 401). 또한 비-OpenAI 프로바이더 모델명을 ALL_AVAILABLE_MODELS 에\n  등록해 ''Unknown model glm-5.2'' 검증 오류 우회.\n- graph.py _fetch_chunks: 다른 함수 스코프의 emb_service 를 참조하던 NameError 를\n  파라미터 전달로 수정(그래프 검색 결과가 조용히 폐기되던 문제).\n\n배경/함정 상세: docs/architecture/model-config-and-pipeline-contract.md §4\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: reorganize documentation — index/ADRs/spec-v2, archive stale docs\n\n- docs/README.md 색인 신설(문서별 상태·검증일), 현행 specification-v2.md\n  (코드 전수조사 기반, v1은 _archive/로 강등), ADR 3건(파이프라인 채택/\n  HTTP 인제스트/SQLite→MongoDB), 모델·파이프라인 계약 문서(LLM 연동 함정 포함),\n  startup 가이드 deploy/ 기준 재작성, arch/ 역할 선언, 잔재 아카이브.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Duke Kimm <dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e9342721b1580126c83364620f780a6dd306fe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/2e9342721b1580126c83364620f780a6dd306fe1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/778c2d2639c4d2784ba6b5b31c05153a7f1f63ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e9342721b1580126c83364620f780a6dd306fe1\nparent 3bf87c5ebe3464889535a51299c5b707e5706994\nauthor duke.kimm <duke.kimm7@gmail.com> 1784093221 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784093221 +0900\n\nfeat: platform MF 연계 + 그래프 파이프라인 버그 수정 + 문서 재편 (#35)\n\n* fix: custom LLM providers in graph ingest + fetch_chunks NameError\n\n- ingest_service _get_llm/_get_embedding_model: LlamaIndex는 base_url이 아니라\n  api_base 를 사용하므로 base_url= 을 api_base= 로 수정(무시되어 커스텀 키가\n  OpenAI 로 가 401). 또한 비-OpenAI 프로바이더 모델명을 ALL_AVAILABLE_MODELS 에\n  등록해 ''Unknown model glm-5.2'' 검증 오류 우회.\n- graph.py _fetch_chunks: 다른 함수 스코프의 emb_service 를 참조하던 NameError 를\n  파라미터 전달로 수정(그래프 검색 결과가 조용히 폐기되던 문제).\n\n배경/함정 상세: docs/architecture/model-config-and-pipeline-contract.md §4\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: reorganize documentation — index/ADRs/spec-v2, archive stale docs\n\n- docs/README.md 색인 신설(문서별 상태·검증일), 현행 specification-v2.md\n  (코드 전수조사 기반, v1은 _archive/로 강등), ADR 3건(파이프라인 채택/\n  HTTP 인제스트/SQ