ganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/5345503b8ec4152b999f877dfd5ac6811ef8c1b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:38:14Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:38:14Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"Install infra contract listener (consumer-template from shared-infra)\n\nSubscribes RAGaaS to shared-infra''s connection-contract changes:\nadditive changes auto-apply to .contract/contract.lock.json, breaking\nchanges open an approval-gated PR (label needs-approval).\n\n- .infra-deps.yml: declares RAGaaS''s actual dependency surface\n  (milvus, fuseki, neo4j, redis, mongo, minio, etcd)\n- .contract/contract.lock.json: seeded from shared-infra''s current\n  published contract (2.0.0, post port-remap) so this starts in sync\n  rather than immediately flagging a false-positive breaking change\n- .github/workflows/infra-contract-listener.yml: repository_dispatch\n  receiver + hourly catch-up cron\n- .claude/hooks/: SessionStart drift check for interactive sessions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32389d92542df74d1e418896af8df79c16931f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/32389d92542df74d1e418896af8df79c16931f95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/5345503b8ec4152b999f877dfd5ac6811ef8c1b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"c