.md: C1-C3 joint verification passed in a\n  real browser (Phase 1 onboarding complete); the API-fallback\n  contract proposal from PR #32 was accepted into contract 05 §5\n- ragaas-notice-2026-07-07c.md: Account/Notice per-app scoping —\n  informational only, no RAGaaS action required\n\nNo code changes; ./manifest remains unimplemented (optional, not a\nblocker) pending a separate decision.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AMnZ6fuSmxfNNTtKsspHLM","tree":{"sha":"779a991d24e1134a6ce00dd1669b039c90030047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/779a991d24e1134a6ce00dd1669b039c90030047"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/b0b63421c7c12534b501dda8f2249d4498472e99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/b0b63421c7c12534b501dda8f2249d4498472e99","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKGIwYjYzNDIxYzdjMTI1MzRiNTAxZGRhOGYyMjQ5ZDQ0OTg0NzJlOT