l":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/12a9f54dcd2ca153cf68bb3f2407a9decb85eae4","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDEyYTlmNTRkY2QyY2ExNTNjZjY4YmIzZjI0MDdhOWRlY2I4NWVhZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/ec414fcb6166f708403af53745377a3b483d4662","sha":"ec414fcb6166f708403af53745377a3b483d4662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/ec414fcb6166f708403af53745377a3b483d4662"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b","sha":"1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b"}],"sha":"12a9f54dcd2ca153cf68bb3f2407a9decb85eae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/12a9f54dcd2ca153cf68bb3f2407a9decb85eae4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:37:09Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:37:09Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(platform): onboard RAGaaS as Module Federation remote in Platform-App shell\n\nGoJIRA Platform-App을 다제품 MFE 셸로 삼는 플랫폼 전략에 따라 RAGaaS를 두\n번째 remote로 합류시킨다. 계약은 docs/platform-contract/ (01~06 + openapi,\nGoJIRA 팀 확정본) — 구현은 이 계약을 따른다.\n\n프론트엔드:\n- React 18.3.1 → 19.2.7 상향(플랫폼 셸/GoJIRA-App과 MF shared singleton\n  정렬 필수). Kendo 5.8.0은 라이선스 구독 만료(2024-04-05)로 상향 금지,\n  React 19 런타임에서 동작 검증됨.\n- @module-federation/vite 로 MF remote 구성: name ragaasApp, exposes\n  {''./App''}, shared react/react-dom singleton. dev 포트 5173→3002.\n- src/App.tsx를 RemoteAppProps{user, authority, resetKey, basePath,\n  onNavigate}를 받는 마운트 진입점으로 재구성. 셸 모드는 MemoryRouter(URL\n  비반영), standalone은 BrowserRouter.\n- src/platform/auth.ts: 셸이 게시하는 window.__platformAuth를 우선 소비하고\n  standalone(SSO 쿠키 introspect 또는 dev 사용자) 폴백. 자체 로그인 금지.\n- src/platform/config.ts: window._env_ 1순위 런타임 설정 로더.\n- services/api.ts axios 인스턴스에 인증 인터셉터 적용(Bearer 또는 X-User-Id\n  폴백, 401 → requireLogin()).\n- 컨테이너 entrypoint.sh가 기동 시 env → env.js 직렬화(재빌드 없이 게이트웨이\n  호스트/스킴 교체). nginx에 remoteEntry.js CORS+no-store 헤더 추가.\n- Node 18→22 (frontend Dockerfile) — @module-federation/vite 의존성(undici)이\n  Node 20+ 전역 File을 요구.\n\n백엔드(backend·ingest_service 공용):\n- API 베이스를 /api/v2 로 표준화(게이트웨이가 /ragaas-api/ 프리픽스를 strip).\n- app/core/platform_auth.py: 신원 확정 미들웨어(OPTIONS/공개경로 통과 →\n  X-Service-Token(hmac.compare_digest) → USE_SSO introspect → dev 폴백\n  X-User-Id/X-Dev-User/DEV_USER). 서비스간 호출(ingest_client, ingest 콜백)에\n  X-Service-Token 부착.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AMnZ6fuSmxfNNTtKsspHLM","tree":{"sha":"af7a89305b122181d0f50e369e228b80bea6d9d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/af7a89305b122181d0f50e369e228b80bea6d9d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDFjYzQ3ZDgyMzI3MWZhZWE0NDFjZTM4ZDc3M2I1ODUyMDg1MTlkOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63","sha":"a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63"}],"sha":"1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/1cc47d823271faea441ce38d773b585208519d9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:36:43Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:36:43Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(llm): unify LLM invocation via direct internal gateway calls\n\n폐쇄망(사내망) 운영을 위해 프록시를 걷어내고 모든 LLM 챗 호출을 단일\nachat()/chat() (raw HTTP, backend·ingest 공용 app/core/llm.py) 로 통일한다.\nopenai SDK 기반 챗 호출을 전면 제거(임베딩은 SDK 유지)하고, 인증/응답파싱/\n오류처리를 한 경로로 모은다.\n\n- LLMError 기반 fail-loud: 네트워크 오류·4xx/5xx·빈 응답·모델/자격 미설정을\n  숨기지 않고 예외로 올린다. 임의 모델 기본값 주입과 예외를 삼키는 조용한\n  fallback을 제거했다 — 임의 fallback은 착오로 인한 잘못된 결과를 유발한다.\n- gpt-oss 계열 응답의 reasoning_content/reasoning 파싱 지원(정상 응답 파싱이지\n  fallback이 아님).\n- 헤더 기반 인증(X-Dep-Ticket 등)을 우선하고, api_key가 있을 때만 Bearer 추가.\n- models_resolver의 시크릿을 ${ENV} 로 치환(평문 DB 저장 회피).\n- 사내 다종 모델을 backend/app/config/internal_models.json 설정파일로 등록해\n  provider_id=\"internal\" 로 해석 — 모델별 endpoint가 달라도 코드 변경 없이\n  파일 편집만으로 추가 가능. list_providers()가 이를 합성 프로바이더로 노출해\n  기존 프론트 모델 셀렉터가 변경 없이 표시한다.\n- retrieval/keyword/reranker/graph(cypher·sparql generator, neo4j·fuseki\n  backend)/ingestion(dictionary_builder, graph, noun_extractor,\n  contextual_grouper, subject_restoration) 전체를 achat/chat 소비로 전환.\n- graph2ontology(승격/온톨로지-QA, 현재 미사용 서브시스템) 4개 생성기는\n  공용 응답파서(extract_content_from_dict)+raise_for_status만 적용 — 완전한\n  chat() 전환은 이 서브시스템을 실사용할 때 진행.\n- 설계 결정 문서: docs/arch/decision/llm-invocation.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AMnZ6fuSmxfNNTtKsspHLM","tree":{"sha":"db6c8ffb07101b3c88ff782cb7383ab002a214f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/db6c8ffb07101b3c88ff782cb7383ab002a214f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKGE2ZGQ4NWRiYzc4ZDQ0N2FkMGZkMmMxZDE2NWExNWVhM2UzYWZjNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/3a626158d715079a69b5e4c821ab1ca1e411bd35","sha":"3a626158d715079a69b5e4c821ab1ca1e411bd35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/3a626158d715079a69b5e4c821ab1ca1e411bd35"}],"sha":"a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/a6dd85dbc78d447ad0fd2c1d165a15ea3e3afc63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/3a626158d715079a69b5e4c821ab1ca1e411bd35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:36:06Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:36:06Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"chore: consolidate deployment onto shared-infra, drop legacy proxy/deploy artifacts\n\nRAGaaS 앱 스택을 GoJIRA와 공용하는 shared-infra(D:\\Works\\shared-infra) 위에서\n동작하도록 docker-compose.yml을 재작성. 임베디드 Milvus/Fuseki/Neo4j/Redis\n컨테이너 정의를 제거하고 shared-net 경유로 외부 스택을 참조한다.\n\n- 사내망 LLM 게이트웨이 직접 호출로 전환하며 samsung-ds-proxy 서비스 제거\n  (proxy/ 디렉토리 전체 삭제 — 별도 커밋에서 다루는 achat/chat 통일과 짝)\n- 플랫폼 합류를 위한 SSO/서비스토큰 런타임 env를 compose/.env.example에 반영\n- 사용하지 않는 레거시 스크립트/compose 변형 제거: ubuntu_deploy/,\n  install_tools.sh, neo4j_service.yml, restart_services.sh,\n  docker-compose.{external-milvus,infra,prod}.yml, cleanup-airgap.sh,\n  create-airgap-package.sh, .env.docker\n- 운영 문서(README/DEV_RUN/LOCAL-RUN/LOCAL_SETUP/DOCKER/AIRGAP-DEPLOY)를\n  변경된 토폴로지·포트(dev 3002)·Node 20+ 요구사항에 맞게 갱신\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AMnZ6fuSmxfNNTtKsspHLM","tree":{"sha":"8f0c2b9555e8633527a08ef05621f0e90f773a13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/8f0c2b9555e8633527a08ef05621f0e90f773a13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/3a626158d715079a69b5e4c821ab1ca1e411bd35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,