,"sha":"1a434f58401baddb3f455b8e6d9acb61ca7cce88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/1a434f58401baddb3f455b8e6d9acb61ca7cce88"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/28fab0ae6c9a76c75461bb555f40cca543f1b54d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T01:11:49Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T01:11:49Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"feat: LLM 모델 선택 UI 및 파이프라인 필터 개선\n\n- ModelSelector: Custom 프로바이더를 드롭다운에 통합, 선택 시 등록 폼 인라인 표시\n- ModelSelector: 설정 아이콘 제거, 전체 UI 클릭으로 팝업 열기\n- ModelSelector: 프로바이더 이름 숨기고 아이콘+모델명만 표시, 수직 정렬 미세 조정\n- ModelSelector: 모든 한글 UI 텍스트 영어로 변환\n- PipelineBuilder: Graph/Rerank 필터 model_type을 LLM으로 고정, LLM/EMB 선택 버튼 제거\n- PipelineBuilder: Rerank Use LLM + LLM Strategy를 None/Full/Limited 단일 드롭다운으로 통합\n- PipelineBuilder: BM25 Tokenizer, Rerank LLM 드롭다운 수직 레이아웃 적용\n- PipelineBuilder: 필터 카드 높이 170px → 160px 축소\n- Backend: query-prompt/content API를 실제 사용되는 txt 파일에서 직접 로드하도록 수정\n- Backend: query-prompt/save API를 txt 파일에 저장하도록 수정\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"2d6bc3113b7f299c5dc29ac9981eed0560694625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/2d6bc3113b7f299c5dc29ac9981eed0560694625"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/28fab0ae6c9a76c75461bb555f40cca543f1b54d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/28fab0ae6c9a76c75461bb555f40cca543f1b54d","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDI4ZmFiMGFlNmM5YTc2Yzc1NDYxYmI1NTVmNDBjY2E1NDNmMWI1NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/c8d41153aa2a739b632430f7e7a270235dea7fb2","sha":"c8d41153aa2a739b632430f7e7a270235dea7fb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/c8d41153aa2a739b63243