20feda61c2162f667bee932fe4567b833","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDdiYjI1OGIyMGZlZGE2MWMyMTYyZjY2N2JlZTkzMmZlNDU2N2I4MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994","sha":"6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994"}],"sha":"7bb258b20feda61c2162f667bee932fe4567b833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/7bb258b20feda61c2162f667bee932fe4567b833"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-31T15:33:27Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-31T15:33:27Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"온톨로지 승급 기능 수정 및 문서 삭제 시 자동 정리 구현\n\n- graph2ontology 모듈을 활용한 승급 로직으로 전환\n- GraphStoreExporter 추가: Fuseki/Neo4j에서 직접 트리플 추출\n- UnionGraph를 사용하여 모든 Named Graph의 트리플 조회\n- 문서 삭제 시 Promotion 아티팩트 자동 정리 (Ontology 그래프, 메타데이터)\n- doc2onto_backup 폐기 및 정리\n- LLM 모델 o1 → gpt-4o 변경으로 비용 최적화\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"f918f37a2f70b6804a6634bfb83061af6ab61783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/f918f37a2f70b6804a6634bfb83061af6ab61783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDZjYjEwZDJhYzIyNjZlNGE3ZTY0ZGMyZjI1NDgwMWE0ZTYwZWI5OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2","sha":"5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2"}],"sha":"6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/6cb10d2ac2266e4a7e64dc2f254801a4e60eb994"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-31T11:48:32Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-31T11:48:32Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"Neo4j 백엔드 개선: Fuseki 최신 기능 동기화\n\nFuseki에 적용된 최신 개선사항을 Neo4j 백엔드에도 반영:\n\n1. Multi-hop 패턴 감지 강화\n   - 의 x2 감지 시 Fast Path 완전히 건너뛰기\n   - 엔티티 추출/해결 단계도 multi-hop 시 스킵\n\n2. 디버깅 로그 대폭 강화\n   - Step-by-step 실행 로그 추가 (Step 1-3)\n   - LLM 호출 전후 상세 정보 출력\n   - 파라미터 및 결과 타입/길이 출력\n\n3. 에러 처리 개선\n   - Full traceback 자동 수집 및 출력\n   - trace_logs에 에러 상세 정보 포함\n\n4. 코드 일관성 향상\n   - dynamic_schema_enabled 변수 명시적 관리\n   - Fuseki와 동일한 로깅 패턴 적용\n\n이제 Neo4j와 Fuseki가 동일한 수준의 디버깅 기능과 코드 품질을 보유\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd02219b976f430d321ca710cc2d35fd895f7563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/bd02219b976f430d321ca710cc2d35fd895f7563"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDVkOTVmMzg0YWZmZGE4YTkzM2YxNjlhMzM1OWU1MjQwMzBmMjc1YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f","sha":"2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f"}],"sha":"5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/5d95f384affda8a933f169a3359e524030f275c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-31T09:06:33Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-31T09:06:33Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"Fuseki 멀티홉 검증 완료\n\n문제 해결:\n1. Multi-hop 쿼리 패턴 감지 로직 추가 (의 x2 감지)\n2. kb_schema → schema_info 변수명 오류 수정\n3. SPARQL 실행 로직을 Fast Path 블록 밖으로 이동하여 multi-hop 쿼리 시 실행되도록 수정\n4. Milvus 자동 재연결 로직 추가 (백엔드 reload 시 연결 유실 방지)\n\n테스트 결과:\n- \"성기훈의 스승의 스승은 누구야?\" 쿼리 정상 작동\n- 2단계 관계 탐색 성공: 성기훈 → 오일남 → Duke\n- 5개의 관련 청크 반환 및 정확한 답변 생성\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7256a188f9315649d40d91d341d2971db018b715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/7256a188f9315649d40d91d341d2971db018b715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDJlYTFmZGIwOGU5YmJjZGU0YzU0NDI2YTJlYjU5MGI4M2E1Yjg1NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/ea92543d285a85470203162535071614b3d4ba25","sha":"ea92543d285a85470203162535071614b3d4ba25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/ea92543d285a85470203162535071614b3d4ba25"}],"sha":"2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commits/2ea1fdb08e9bbcde4c54426a2eb590b83a5b856f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/com