구현: Pattern 1, 2, 3에 대해 LLM 우회 직접 SPARQL 쿼리 실행\n- 부분 일치 검색 지원: CONTAINS 필터로 ''장풍'', ''장풍의 고수'' 등 모두 검색 가능\n- 양방향 검색 강화: UNION 쿼리로 역관계 자동 추론 (물리적 inverse 불필요)\n- 메타데이터 필터링: rdf:subject, rdf:predicate, rdf:object, rdfs:label 제외\n- UI 개선: Graph 청크 색상을 초록색에서 파란색 계열로 통일\n- Inference 옵션 제거: 검색 시점 추론 방식으로 일원화\n- 문서 삭제 UI/UX 개선: WebSocket 안정화 및 즉각적인 상태 업데이트\n- 프롬프트 개선: 엔티티 정의 확장 및 동사형 관계 추출 예시 추가","tree":{"sha":"34e5d41702505ff52b089e47dbdf95141dc2b9b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/34e5d41702505ff52b089e47dbdf95141dc2b9b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/b44de4324f9ed10829682812455b5b491d1ec035","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/b44de4324f9ed10829682812455b5b491d1ec035","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKGI0NGRlNDMyNGY5ZWQxMDgyOTY4MjgxMjQ1NWI1YjQ5MWQxZWMwMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/38cb78f81101bb50ae15303d003abbe4517b064d","sha":"38cb78f81101bb50