st 결과 패널 UI 개선 (Blue 테마 적용)\n- [FE] 추출된 트리플 개별/전체 선택 및 저장 기능(Apply) 구현\n- [FE] ChunksModal, GraphDataTable 등 컴포넌트에 kbId 전달 구조 추가\n- [API] 트리플 선택 저장을 위한 Ingest API 연동 (saveChunkTriples)\n- [BE] Ingest Service: /save-chunk-triples 엔드포인트 추가 (Fuseki/Neo4j 저장 지원)\n- [BE] 문서 삭제 시 고아 데이터 정리 로직 개선 (cleanup_service.py)","tree":{"sha":"eba233c0342dccf42d020db8f4ca560c5cbcc08a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/trees/eba233c0342dccf42d020db8f4ca560c5cbcc08a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/git/commits/871e53fce923e7a7df9983aa07401d3837bcd623","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/871e53fce923e7a7df9983aa07401d3837bcd623","node_id":"C_kwDOQKbLl9oAKDg3MWU1M2ZjZTkyM2U3YTdkZjk5ODNhYTA3NDAxZDM4MzdiY2Q2MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/RAGaaS/commit/d4d8f48e8c1197060d22050ce1be11fb8d0cf57a","sha":"d4d8f48e8c1197060d22050ce1be11fb8d0cf57a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/RAGaaS/