or Docker image build and publish\n\n- Create a new workflow file `.github/workflows/docker-publish.yml` to automate the building and pushing of Docker images for middleware, admin frontend, and backend services.\n- Implement a matrix strategy to determine which services to build based on user input or changes.\n- Include steps for logging into GitHub Container Registry, building images with Docker Buildx, and generating image digests.\n- Add a security scan job using Trivy for vulnerability assessment of built images.\n- Implement a summary job to publish the results of the build process.\n\nAdd container registry guide documentation\n\n- Create `CONTAINER_REGISTRY_GUIDE.md` to provide a comprehensive guide on using GitHub Container Registry for SanRats images.\n- Include sections on pulling images, available tags, updating Docker Compose, authentication methods, triggering builds, and troubleshooting common issues.\n\nAdd management scripts for Docker images\n\n- Introduce `scripts/manage-images.bat` for Windows users to manage Docker images, including login, pull, tag, info, cleanup, and trigger build commands.\n- Add `scripts/manage-images.sh` for Linux/Mac users with similar functionalities as the Windows script, utilizing GitHub CLI for authentication and workflow triggering.","tree":{"sha":"32e484de34e06637068a967955d07f785ae3ac82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sankutto/SanRats-FYP/git/trees/32e484de34e06637068a967955d07f785ae3ac82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sankutto/SanRats-FYP/git/commits/bb142a51977aa9440fcbdf9fa3257ea45dea88a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49372490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"