tPolicyInfo` for policy resolution.\n- Enhanced `PolicyTemplate` to support JSONB array handling.\n- Updated `TenantConfig` and `TenantRoutePolicy` to utilize new JSONB types.\n- Implemented `EndpointPolicyResolver` for resolving endpoint policies and validating access.\n- Created migration scripts for `customization_routes` and `endpoint_policy_mappings` tables.\n- Added views for customization route catalog and endpoint policy coverage.\n- Included sample data for common customizations and endpoint policies.","tree":{"sha":"98fac6a9c02bf075ba50a919efa8172fbbfcf2ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sankutto/SanRats-FYP/git/trees/98fac6a9c02bf075ba50a919efa8172fbbfcf2ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sankutto/SanRats-FYP/git/commits/517bc186bba0328b62c96d1f9db0967d1f8e0489","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49372490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thusalapi","id":49372490,"login":"thusalapi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MzcyNDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thusalapi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sankutto/SanRats-FYP/commit/517bc186bba0328b62c96d1f9db0967d1f8e0489","node_id":"C_kwDOQKtFR9oAKDUxN2JjMTg2YmJ