"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/ed4345391c98de77fe23b096205b7c1f57a69c45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:05:43Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:05:43Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"message":"Sort state object keys alphabetically in passive plan state viewer\n\nUnderscore-prefixed base-contract keys (_a, _s, _t) sort first since\n''_'' (ASCII 95) is below lowercase letters (97+) — uses plain\ncodepoint comparison rather than localeCompare so this holds\nregardless of locale. Purely a display-order change in the \"Latest\nmessage\" JSON viewer; the underlying state object elsewhere is\nuntouched.\n\nVerified live: DMX_SPKFN_1''s state now renders _s, _t, then\nb/b1-3, dr/dr1-3, ei/ei1-3, g/g1-3, r/r1-3 in alphabetical order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c4b5d62a63ffd52f1e2d11e79b2432bdc29a60c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/trees/2c4b5d62a63ffd52f1e2d11e79b2432bdc29a60c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/commits/ed4345391c98de77fe23b096205b7c1f57a69c45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3826207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/ed4345391c98de77fe23b096205b7c1f57a69c45","node_id":"C_kwDOQLTkodoAKGVkNDM0NTM5MWM5OGRlNzdmZTIzYjA5NjIwNWI3YzFmNTdhNjljNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee","sha":"1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee"}],"sha":"ed4345391c98de77fe23b096205b7c1f57a69c45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/ed4345391c98de77fe23b096205b7c1f57a69c45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3826207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:03:08Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:03:08Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"message":"Let passive plan state panel size to content, not a guessed height\n\nReplaces the fixed max-height (which needed bumping every time the\nstate payload grew) with no cap at all. commander__dialog-body (the\nmodal''s own overflow-y:auto scroll container) already handles the\ncase where the whole panel exceeds the viewport, so this inner box\nnever needs its own scrollbar or a hardcoded size guess.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5eee922e4a4d098f1579ac165292c2f2356e405e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/trees/5eee922e4a4d098f1579ac165292c2f2356e405e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/commits/1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3826207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee","node_id":"C_kwDOQLTkodoAKDFmMmI5NWUwMjg2OTVjMzc1Mjk0ZTcxODc3NmYyZmNhZWJmM2I1ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb","sha":"22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb"}],"sha":"1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/1f2b95e028695c375294e718776f2fcaebf3b5ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3826207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:02:24Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:02:24Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"message":"Decode _s as full PlanState when no player context, grow msg panel\n\n_s now means two different things depending on the fixture: player\nplaying/stopped (0/1) when a player is attached, or the raw PlanState\nordinal (0-6: OFF/IDLE/PREPARE/READY/RUNNING/STOPPED/ERROR) for\nNO_PLAYER fixtures with trigger/stop capability (new base-firmware\nStep 1b). Disambiguates by checking whether _l (player volume) is\nalso present in the same state object, since the two are never\nemitted for the same fixture.\n\nAlso grows .commander__passive-ps-last-msg''s max-height (14rem ->\n50rem) so the full \"Latest message\" JSON viewer fits without an\ninternal scrollbar for fixtures with larger state payloads (verified\nagainst DMX_SPKFN_1''s ~22-field state block).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b21676457fe2775e0a6f4062dd91ebf6e6909219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/trees/b21676457fe2775e0a6f4062dd91ebf6e6909219"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/commits/22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3826207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb","node_id":"C_kwDOQLTkodoAKDIyNjIyYjY3ZjRmMDU1N2IxMTg2NDQ1NGU2ZDExNTRiN2Y0MzI4ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/9e11575ff6e53beb23786040cba69d57036ca6fd","sha":"9e11575ff6e53beb23786040cba69d57036ca6fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/9e11575ff6e53beb23786040cba69d57036ca6fd"}],"sha":"22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/22622b67f4f0557b11864454e6d1154b7f4328fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3826207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commits/9e11575ff6e53beb23786040cba69d57036ca6fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:35:37Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:35:37Z","email":"hans@netmatic.nl","name":"hanskerkhof"},"message":"Annotate base-contract state fields in passive plan state viewer\n\nThe \"Latest message\" JSON viewer in the fixture detail modal showed\nraw underscore-prefixed keys (_t, _l, _q, _i, _s, _e, _d, _a) with no\nindication of what they mean, e.g. \"_t: 1788427467\" or \"_s: 1\" with\nno context. These are the CU_PLAYER base-contract fields shared\nacross many plans (see docs/PLAYER_TYPES.md), so this is a generic\nannotation, not gated to any specific plan.\n\nAdds a display-only annotation layer (annotateStateForDisplay) that\nappends a human-readable suffix to known keys before rendering, e.g.\n_t becomes \"1788427467 (timestamp: 9/3/2026, 11:31:38 AM)\" and _s\nbecomes \"1 (player PLAYING)\". The underlying signal used elsewhere\n(selectedFixturePlayerState etc.) is untouched — this only affects\nthe passivePsLastMsg -> ngx-json-viewer binding.\n\nVerified live against both DMX_SPKFN_1 (plain-named fields pass\nthrough unchanged, _t gets the timestamp annotation) and FANOUS_FI_1\n(all seven base-contract fields annotated correctly).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6b04b4a6225b92703c2f00dfafee219364f664e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/trees/e6b04b4a6225b92703c2f00dfafee219364f664e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/git/commits/9e11575ff6e53beb23786040cba69d57036ca6fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3826207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof","id":3826207,"login":"hanskerkhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjYyMDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanskerkhof","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/9e11575ff6e53beb23786040cba69d57036ca6fd","node_id":"C_kwDOQLTkodoAKDllMTE1NzVmZjZlNTNiZWIyMzc4NjA0MGNiYTY5ZDU3MDM2Y2E2ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanskerkhof/serial-logger/commit/90ebd8c5c97162af8eb110a31ea27cb089970c98","sha":"90ebd8c5c97162af8eb110a31ea27cb089970c98","url":"https://api.github.com/re